From: WIN harness <win@meetflowai.local>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 16:02:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(activation): verify license with server, drop dev
 backdoor + hardcoded secret

- ActivationService: remove AutoActivatedMachineName/UserName bypass and the hardcoded LicenseSecret; validate the stored license with POST {ActivationApiUrl}/verify instead of a local HMAC signature, so a hand-written license.json cannot unlock the app.

- GetMachineId: ignore placeholder OEM/VM WMI UUIDs (all 0 / all F) so one key cannot cover many machines.

- MeetFlowAI.iss: point SourceDir at the new self-contained win-x64 build.

- docs: activation is server-verified; production endpoint is https://api.meetflowai.site/v1/ai/license.
