 ## Activation
 
 Activation is machine-bound without user login. The local license is under
-`%LOCALAPPDATA%\MeetFlowAI\license.json` and is checked against the machine
-identifier and expiry. See `docs/activation.md` for Firebase deployment and
-key generation.
+`%LOCALAPPDATA%\MeetFlowAI\license.json` and only remembers the key, machine
+identifier, plan, and expiry. No signing secret is shipped: on startup the app
+asks the activation server (`POST {ActivationApiUrl}/verify`) whether the
+`key` + `machineId` pair is still valid, and account revocation, device limits,
+and expiry are decided there. A hand-written `license.json` cannot unlock the
+app. See `docs/activation.md` for the endpoint and key generation.
 
